{"id":"99daa28c1863bae0","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-clauseconsensus.md","title":"Clause consensus","display":"df-clauseconsensus — Clause consensus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-clauseconsensus","aliases":["27-df-clauseconsensus"],"display":"df-clauseconsensus — Clause consensus","depends_on":["[[27-df-clause]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.7, disjunctive counterpart of consensus","source_printed_pages":"92–95","source_pdf_pages":"116–119","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-normalized-dual-construction","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-clauseconsensus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-clauseconsensus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clauseconsensus — Clause consensus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.7, disjunctive counterpart of consensus"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"92–95"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"116–119"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-normalized-dual-construction"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_L,C_M\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n\">\\(C_L,C_M\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)\">\\(L=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_M)\">\\(M=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_M)\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span> 表示部分函数有定义。</p>\n<p>本节定义目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsClause}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsClause}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clause}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Clause}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Clause}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\)</span> 型部分函数符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_C(L,M)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid(x_i\\in L\\land\\bar x_i\\in M)\\lor(\\bar x_i\\in L\\land x_i\\in M)\\}\\quad(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_C(L,M)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid(x_i\\in L\\land\\bar x_i\\in M)\\lor(\\bar x_i\\in L\\land x_i\\in M)\\}\\quad(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsClause}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in[n]}\\left\\{(L,M,i)\\mid(L,M)\\in\\{(L&#39;,M&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n^2:K_C(L&#39;,M&#39;)=\\{i\\}\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsClause}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in[n]}\\left\\{(L,M,i)\\mid(L,M)\\in\\{(L&#39;,M&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n^2:K_C(L&#39;,M&#39;)=\\{i\\}\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsClause}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left((C_L,C_M),C_{(L\\cup M)\\setminus\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}}\\right)\\mid(L,M,i)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsClause}}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsClause}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left((C_L,C_M),C_{(L\\cup M)\\setminus\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}}\\right)\\mid(L,M,i)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsClause}}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsClause}:\\mathrm{Clause}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Clause}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConsClause}(C_L,C_M)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow(C_L,C_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsClause}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsClause}:\\mathrm{Clause}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Clause}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConsClause}(C_L,C_M)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow(C_L,C_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsClause}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C_L,C_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsClause})\\Longleftrightarrow|K_C(L,M)|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C_L,C_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsClause})\\Longleftrightarrow|K_C(L,M)|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是恰有一个互补坐标时的非恒真 resolvent。把一般归结的恒真结果省略；通过 CLits 唯一性及 K_C 的单元素条件保证单值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$C_L,C_M\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n$，$L=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)$，$M=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_M)$；见 [[27-df-clause]]。$\\downarrow$ 表示部分函数有定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C_L,C_M\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_L)","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\mathrm{CLits}(C_M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsClause}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clause}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Clause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"K_C(L,M)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]\\mid(x_i\\in L\\land\\bar x_i\\in M)\\lor(\\bar x_i\\in L\\land x_i\\in M)\\}\\quad(L,M\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsClause}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in[n]}\\left\\{(L,M,i)\\mid(L,M)\\in\\{(L',M')\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n^2:K_C(L',M')=\\{i\\}\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsClause}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left((C_L,C_M),C_{(L\\cup M)\\setminus\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}}\\right)\\mid(L,M,i)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{ConsClause}}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsClause}:\\mathrm{Clause}_n^2\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Clause}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConsClause}(C_L,C_M)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow(C_L,C_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsClause}).","display":true},{"tex":"(C_L,C_M)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsClause})\\Longleftrightarrow|K_C(L,M)|=1.","display":true}],"bytes":2037,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-clauseconsensus|df-clauseconsensus — Clause consensus]]"}],"outgoing":["74438714e304bba9"]}